{"id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-formula.md","title":"Modal Formula","display":"df-modal-formula — Modal Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-formula","aliases":["89-df-modal-formula"],"display":"df-modal-formula — Modal Formula","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-formula — Modal Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> is a set of propositional letters, disjoint from the\nsyntactic constructors <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\\)</span>; these constructors are\nread as distinct tagged constructors.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\;((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\;(\\Box\\varphi\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\;((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\;(\\Box\\varphi\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> : 模态公式集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 必然算子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> : 恒假公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot\">\\(\\top\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\">\\(\\Diamond\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a> 定义，不是新的原始构造子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\Diamond$ 由 [[89-df-diamond-modality]] 定义，不是新的原始构造子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in X),\\\\\n&\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\;((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X),\\\\\n&\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\;(\\Box\\varphi\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\top\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond","display":false}],"bytes":1019,"backlinks":[{"id":"883bfda9f28cc5ea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c78885ae02bfb25f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the freely generated modal-formula set from\n[[89-df-modal-formula]]."},{"id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c6e69f0f07e062bc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d04b869450b424f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ece6738da9dd31ad","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"40b00bc10cced0e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7ed22bf7259dd6b3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f661762c12e8f92b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-formula]])."},{"id":"0218073c